<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Your workspace · Prepto</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheet/product.css"><script defer src="/productCommon.js"></script></head><body class="product"><%- include('partials/productNav') %><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><p class="eyebrow">A little better, every session</p><h1>Build your next opportunity.</h1><p class="subtle">Choose one focused activity, keep your work and review what to practice next.</p><section class="hero card" aria-labelledby="next-step"><div><span class="badge">Start here</span><h2 id="next-step">One question. A clearer explanation.</h2><p>Pick a bank question, pause when you need to and return to a saved interview review.</p><a class="button" href="/interviews">Start a practice interview</a></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Your preparation loop</p><ol><li>Explore a question or coding problem.</li><li>Practice and save your work.</li><li>Review feedback and choose a study goal.</li></ol></div></section><section aria-labelledby="workspace-heading"><h2 id="workspace-heading">Your workspace</h2><div class="grid dashboard-grid"><% const activities = [['/question-bank','Explore the question bank','Search by category and difficulty, bookmark questions and start an interview.'],['/coding-practice','Practice coding','18 problems, JavaScript/Python drafts and saved AI feedback. Code execution is disabled.'],['/resumes','Improve your resume','Preserve versions, edit a copy and export a readable PDF.'],['/resume-matches','Review job matches','Compare saved feedback for the same job description. AI scores are estimates.'],['/progress','Review your progress','See attempt history, interview skill trends and separate coding AI estimates.'],['/reports','Open saved reports','Return to completed attempts and download your private reports.']]; activities.forEach(([href,title,description]) => { %><article class="card"><h3><a href="<%= href %>"><%= title %></a></h3><p><%= description %></p></article><% }); %></div></section><section class="card" aria-labelledby="more-tools"><h2 id="more-tools">More preparation tools</h2><p class="subtle">Your existing workflows remain available. For saved, cross-device interviews, use Interviews in the navigation above.</p><% if (!demoMode) { %><details><summary>Resume and career tools</summary><ul><li><a href="/resume-builder">Build a resume</a></li><li><a href="/analyze">One-off ATS analysis</a></li><li><a href="/resume-interview">Generate questions from a resume</a></li><li><a href="/careerguidance">Career guidance</a></li></ul></details><details><summary>Legacy guided workflows</summary><p>These rounds use a browser session. Submit before leaving; legacy coding feedback is AI-only.</p><ul><li><a href="/mock-interviews">Legacy guided interview rounds</a></li><li><a href="/coding-test">Legacy guided coding round</a></li><li><a href="/progress/legacy">Original progress dashboard</a></li></ul></details><% } else { %><p>One-off remote tools and legacy guided routes are outside this offline demo. All core navigation above uses isolated synthetic data.</p><% } %></section><p><% if(demoMode) { %><a href="/demo">Exit or reset demo workspace</a><% } else { %><a href="/logout">Sign out</a><% } %></p></main></body></html>
